WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.890
[Upbeat electronic music]

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:01.460
Hey.

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:04.420
Hey, Juno, I have a doctor's appointment
tomorrow.

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:05.860
How should I prepare?

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:07.220
Yep, with Dr. Sahur?

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:11.520
I've prepared a symptom summary and the most
important questions you should ask.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.400
Great. I also have a bad headache now.

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.600
Ah, it looks like they've been getting worse.

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:18.140
I'm looking into it.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:23.160
Hmm. It looks like there's a direct
correlation between the pressure and your
headaches.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.480
Is that something you're aware of?

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:27.300
Hmm, that's interesting.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:28.980
I'll make a note of that.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:37.280
I'll also set a reminder when I notice any
low-pressure days.
